    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nui Goes to Town is an adventure game where you explore and interact with various quirky animal characters while using tools and items to solve simple puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Howdy Neighbor!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cross paths with a cast of cute animal characters as they go about their daily business!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853150/extras/f2bd21450e21210a4cd5ad34e96c96bd.poster.avif?t=1752266492\" width=608 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853150/extras/f2bd21450e21210a4cd5ad34e96c96bd.webm?t=1752266492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853150/extras/f2bd21450e21210a4cd5ad34e96c96bd.mp4?t=1752266492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A friend in need is a friend indeed!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>While you wait for the train:\u00a0 Clean up a picnic disaster!\u00a0 Pack a snack for a friend!\u00a0 Nui is always ready to lend a helping paw, shovel, or axe!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853150/extras/61909f69472b48d96d10b93f260db357.poster.avif?t=1752266492\" width=608 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853150/extras/61909f69472b48d96d10b93f260db357.webm?t=1752266492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853150/extras/61909f69472b48d96d10b93f260db357.mp4?t=1752266492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Aboard!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Discover the mystery of the Giggle Train as the story unfolds in unexpecting ways.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853150/extras/a81adbd000dc4a3e08d85002201c1e5b.poster.avif?t=1752266492\" width=608 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853150/extras/a81adbd000dc4a3e08d85002201c1e5b.webm?t=1752266492\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3853150/extras/a81adbd000dc4a3e08d85002201c1e5b.mp4?t=1752266492\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Warning: This game contains subject matter that is not suitable for children.\u00a0 Player discretion is advised.</strong></i></p>",
